{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41595","headline":"僻居谢何明府见访 · 伍乔","name":"僻居谢何明府见访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公退琴堂动逸怀，闲披烟霭访微才。\n马嘶穷巷蛙声息，辙到衡门草色开。\n风引柳花当坐起，日将林影入庭来。\n满斋尘土一牀藓，多谢从容水饭回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伍乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}